<title>USA: Hurricane Fran threatens shipping off Puerto Rico.</title>
<headline>Hurricane Fran threatens shipping off Puerto Rico.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hurricane Fran continues to slowly gain strength north of Puerto Rico and has top winds of 85 mph, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation said.</p>
<p>Fram is about 800 miles east of Nassau, Bahamas and will continue to track west northwest.</p>
<p>Fran will be a threat to shipping during the next 24-36 hours and may threaten the Bahamas and Florida Wednesday and Thursday.</p>
<p>However, this is still uncertain.</p>
</text>
